{"id":"e22e6b1080a66235","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-pseudodifferential-data.md","title":"Pseudodifferential Symbol and Extension Data","display":"df-pseudodifferential-data — Pseudodifferential Symbol and Extension Data","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-pseudodifferential-data","aliases":["58-df-pseudodifferential-data"],"display":"df-pseudodifferential-data — Pseudodifferential Symbol and Extension Data","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-fourier-sobolev-space.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-complex-schwartz-data.md]]","[[58-df-signed-integral-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-pseudodifferential-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-pseudodifferential-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pseudodifferential-data — Pseudodifferential Symbol and Extension Data"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d47484adcb88c697\" href=\"?note=d47484adcb88c697\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-fourier-sobolev-space.md\">../batch18/58-df-fourier-sobolev-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a6c5654857edae16\" href=\"?note=a6c5654857edae16\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-complex-schwartz-data.md\">../batch06/58-df-complex-schwartz-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" href=\"?note=76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" title=\"58-df-signed-integral-data.md\">58-df-signed-integral-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,s\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(m,s\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_n,\\mathcal S&#39;_n,H^s(\\mathbb R^n),J_n\">\\(\\mathcal S_n,\\mathcal S&#39;_n,H^s(\\mathbb R^n),J_n\\)</span> 及分布的复线性运算取 <code>58-df-fourier-sobolev-space</code>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\omega^n\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\omega^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\beta|=\\sum_{j\\in n}\\beta(j)\">\\(|\\beta|=\\sum_{j\\in n}\\beta(j)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\frown\\xi\\in\\mathbb R^{2n}\">\\(x\\frown\\xi\\in\\mathbb R^{2n}\\)</span> 为函数图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\cup\\{\\langle n+j,\\xi(j)\\rangle:j\\in n\\}\">\\(x\\cup\\{\\langle n+j,\\xi(j)\\rangle:j\\in n\\}\\)</span>，多重指标拼接同式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\cdot\\xi=\\sum_{j\\in n}x(j)\\xi(j)\">\\(x\\cdot\\xi=\\sum_{j\\in n}x(j)\\xi(j)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^n\\times\\mathbb R^n}\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^n\\times\\mathbb R^n}\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(x,\\xi)=a(\\langle x,\\xi\\rangle)\">\\(a(x,\\xi)=a(\\langle x,\\xi\\rangle)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widetilde a=\\{\\langle x\\frown\\xi,a(x,\\xi)\\rangle:x,\\xi\\in\\mathbb R^n\\}\">\\(\\widetilde a=\\{\\langle x\\frown\\xi,a(x,\\xi)\\rangle:x,\\xi\\in\\mathbb R^n\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>原有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{meta}\">\\(\\mathsf{meta}\\)</span> 后缀及各关系的参数顺序保留。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexMultiDerivative}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexMultiDerivative}_S\\)</span> 使用 <code>58-df-complex-schwartz-data</code>；积分值关系取 <code>58-df-signed-integral-data</code>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本文件明确保留原文件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e^{ix\\cdot\\xi}\">\\(e^{ix\\cdot\\xi}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(2\\pi)^{-n}\">\\((2\\pi)^{-n}\\)</span> 核以及上游 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e^{-2\\pi i x\\cdot\\xi}\">\\(e^{-2\\pi i x\\cdot\\xi}\\)</span> Fourier 归一化，不将二者默默替换为另一套约定。只对 Schwartz 输入定义此积分值，故使用通常的绝对收敛积分。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本文件所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_n\">\\(\\mathcal S_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^s\">\\(H^s\\)</span>、导数和函数求值均在已声明的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,m\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(s,m\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span> 及相应函数定义域内解释。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SobolevExtensionGraph}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SobolevExtensionGraph}_S\\)</span> 为五参数关系，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SobolevBoundedExtension}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{SobolevBoundedExtension}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 保留四参数关系。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexIntegralValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexIntegralValue}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" href=\"?note=76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" title=\"58-df-signed-integral-data.md\">58-df-signed-integral-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HormanderSymbol}\">\\(\\mathrm{HormanderSymbol}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OscillatoryKNIntegral}\">\\(\\mathrm{OscillatoryKNIntegral}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchwartzFunction}\">\\(\\mathrm{SchwartzFunction}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchwartzFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land u\\in\\mathcal S_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SchwartzFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land u\\in\\mathcal S_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HormanderSymbol}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(a,n,m)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land m\\in\\mathbb R\\land a\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^n\\times\\mathbb R^n}\n\\land\\widetilde a\\in C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^{2n},\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\omega^n\\;\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^{2n}}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{ComplexMultiDerivative}_S(g,\\widetilde a,\\mathbb R^{2n},2n,\\alpha\\frown\\beta)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x,\\xi\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\n|g(x\\frown\\xi)|\\le C(1+\\|\\xi\\|_2)^{m-|\\beta|}\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HormanderSymbol}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(a,n,m)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land m\\in\\mathbb R\\land a\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^n\\times\\mathbb R^n}\n\\land\\widetilde a\\in C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^{2n},\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\omega^n\\;\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^{2n}}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{ComplexMultiDerivative}_S(g,\\widetilde a,\\mathbb R^{2n},2n,\\alpha\\frown\\beta)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x,\\xi\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\n|g(x\\frown\\xi)|\\le C(1+\\|\\xi\\|_2)^{m-|\\beta|}\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{OscillatoryKNIntegral}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(v;a,\\widehat u,x,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land v\\in\\mathbb C\\land x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\land\\widehat u\\in\\mathcal S_n\n\\land a\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^n\\times\\mathbb R^n}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ComplexIntegralValue}_S\\Bigl((2\\pi)^n v,\n\\{\\langle\\xi,e^{i x\\cdot\\xi}a(x,\\xi)\\widehat u(\\xi)\\rangle:\\xi\\in\\mathbb R^n\\},\n\\mathbb R^n,\\mathcal B_n,\\lambda_n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{OscillatoryKNIntegral}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(v;a,\\widehat u,x,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land v\\in\\mathbb C\\land x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\land\\widehat u\\in\\mathcal S_n\n\\land a\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^n\\times\\mathbb R^n}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ComplexIntegralValue}_S\\Bigl((2\\pi)^n v,\n\\{\\langle\\xi,e^{i x\\cdot\\xi}a(x,\\xi)\\widehat u(\\xi)\\rangle:\\xi\\in\\mathbb R^n\\},\n\\mathbb R^n,\\mathcal B_n,\\lambda_n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SobolevExtensionGraph}_S(E,A,n,s,m)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land s,m\\in\\mathbb R\\land A\\in\\mathcal S_n^{\\mathcal S_n}\n\\land E\\in\\bigl(H^{s-m}(\\mathbb R^n)\\bigr)^{H^s(\\mathbb R^n)}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall T,U\\in H^s(\\mathbb R^n)\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb C\\;\nE(aT+bU)=aE(T)+bE(U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall T\\in H^s(\\mathbb R^n)\\;\n\\|E(T)\\|_{H^{s-m}(\\mathbb R^n)}\\le C\\|T\\|_{H^s(\\mathbb R^n)}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall u\\in\\mathcal S_n\\;E(J_n(u))=J_n(A(u)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SobolevExtensionGraph}_S(E,A,n,s,m)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land s,m\\in\\mathbb R\\land A\\in\\mathcal S_n^{\\mathcal S_n}\n\\land E\\in\\bigl(H^{s-m}(\\mathbb R^n)\\bigr)^{H^s(\\mathbb R^n)}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall T,U\\in H^s(\\mathbb R^n)\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb C\\;\nE(aT+bU)=aE(T)+bE(U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall T\\in H^s(\\mathbb R^n)\\;\n\\|E(T)\\|_{H^{s-m}(\\mathbb R^n)}\\le C\\|T\\|_{H^s(\\mathbb R^n)}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall u\\in\\mathcal S_n\\;E(J_n(u))=J_n(A(u)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SobolevBoundedExtension}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(A,n,s,m)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists!E\\;\\mathrm{SobolevExtensionGraph}_S(E,A,n,s,m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SobolevBoundedExtension}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(A,n,s,m)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists!E\\;\\mathrm{SobolevExtensionGraph}_S(E,A,n,s,m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>符号条件是各阶导数的增长估计；有界延拓条件是一个独立、可检验的算子图条件，不把所需结论写入符号条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-fourier-sobolev-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"d47484adcb88c697","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-fourier-sobolev-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-complex-schwartz-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"a6c5654857edae16","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-complex-schwartz-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-signed-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-signed-integral-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-signed-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ComplexIntegralValue}$ 取 [[58-df-signed-integral-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"m,s\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S_n,\\mathcal S'_n,H^s(\\mathbb R^n),J_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\omega^n","display":false},{"tex":"|\\beta|=\\sum_{j\\in n}\\beta(j)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\frown\\xi\\in\\mathbb R^{2n}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\cup\\{\\langle n+j,\\xi(j)\\rangle:j\\in n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\cdot\\xi=\\sum_{j\\in n}x(j)\\xi(j)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^n\\times\\mathbb R^n}","display":false},{"tex":"a(x,\\xi)=a(\\langle x,\\xi\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\widetilde a=\\{\\langle x\\frown\\xi,a(x,\\xi)\\rangle:x,\\xi\\in\\mathbb R^n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{meta}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComplexMultiDerivative}_S","display":false},{"tex":"e^{ix\\cdot\\xi}","display":false},{"tex":"(2\\pi)^{-n}","display":false},{"tex":"e^{-2\\pi i x\\cdot\\xi}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S_n","display":false},{"tex":"H^s","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"s,m\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SobolevExtensionGraph}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SobolevBoundedExtension}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComplexIntegralValue}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HormanderSymbol}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OscillatoryKNIntegral}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SchwartzFunction}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SchwartzFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega_{>0}\\land u\\in\\mathcal S_n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HormanderSymbol}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(a,n,m)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nn\\in\\omega_{>0}\\land m\\in\\mathbb R\\land a\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^n\\times\\mathbb R^n}\n\\land\\widetilde a\\in C^\\infty(\\mathbb R^{2n},\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\omega^n\\;\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^{2n}}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{ComplexMultiDerivative}_S(g,\\widetilde a,\\mathbb R^{2n},2n,\\alpha\\frown\\beta)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall x,\\xi\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\n|g(x\\frown\\xi)|\\le C(1+\\|\\xi\\|_2)^{m-|\\beta|}\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{OscillatoryKNIntegral}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(v;a,\\widehat u,x,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nn\\in\\omega_{>0}\\land v\\in\\mathbb C\\land x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\land\\widehat u\\in\\mathcal S_n\n\\land a\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^n\\times\\mathbb R^n}\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{ComplexIntegralValue}_S\\Bigl((2\\pi)^n v,\n\\{\\langle\\xi,e^{i x\\cdot\\xi}a(x,\\xi)\\widehat u(\\xi)\\rangle:\\xi\\in\\mathbb R^n\\},\n\\mathbb R^n,\\mathcal B_n,\\lambda_n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SobolevExtensionGraph}_S(E,A,n,s,m)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nn\\in\\omega_{>0}\\land s,m\\in\\mathbb R\\land A\\in\\mathcal S_n^{\\mathcal S_n}\n\\land E\\in\\bigl(H^{s-m}(\\mathbb R^n)\\bigr)^{H^s(\\mathbb R^n)}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall T,U\\in H^s(\\mathbb R^n)\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb C\\;\nE(aT+bU)=aE(T)+bE(U)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall T\\in H^s(\\mathbb R^n)\\;\n\\|E(T)\\|_{H^{s-m}(\\mathbb R^n)}\\le C\\|T\\|_{H^s(\\mathbb R^n)}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall u\\in\\mathcal S_n\\;E(J_n(u))=J_n(A(u)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SobolevBoundedExtension}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(A,n,s,m)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists!E\\;\\mathrm{SobolevExtensionGraph}_S(E,A,n,s,m).","display":true}],"bytes":4073,"backlinks":[{"id":"dc7c265cbb3f6c8f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1015","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-pseudodifferential-data.md|58-df-pseudodifferential-data]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["d47484adcb88c697","a6c5654857edae16","76a1ed4ae7e8b05d"]}